<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>script for the mp5K in R6. 
Disclaimer: DOES NOT WORK ON mp5 only on mp5K
regular mp5 has different recoil
dpi and sensitivity doesnt matter since there is very little recoil, but the screen resolution and aspect ratio does matter.

2560 x 1440 screen resolution

16:10 ratio

900dpi
sensitivity: 17

attachments: 
extended barrel
1.5x scope
</Description>
    <Comment>script for the mp5K in R6. 
Disclaimer: DOES NOT WORK ON mp5 only on mp5K
regular mp5 has different recoil
dpi and sensitivity doesnt matter since there is very little recoil, but the screen resolution and aspect ratio does matter.

